msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Editeu l'estructura del menú com a JSON. Cada element pot tindre: name, "
"icon, command (s'executa a través de l'intèrpret d'ordres) o action (una "
"acció de sessió: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, "
"shutdown), submenu (matriu d'elements) o separator (true)."

